# API keys and tokens
*apikey*
*api-key*
*token*
*secret*

# ...but documentation *about* tokens is not a credential. Without this the
# page is silently dropped from any clean checkout, so CI builds a site that
# is missing a page the author sees locally.
#
# Keep this path in sync with where content actually lives. These patterns
# pointed at the pre-migration Docusaurus directories for a while, which
# silently un-tracked the Launchpad tokens page again.
!content/docs/**/*token*.md
!content/docs/**/*token*.mdx
!content/docs/**/*secret*.md
!content/docs/**/*api-key*.md

