# Claude Code: local machine state stays out, shared project docs go in.
# CLAUDE.md and the migration reference files describe how this repo is
# worked on - they are only useful if everyone (and CI) can read them.
.claude/*
!.claude/CLAUDE.md
!.claude/*.md
